{"1902180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plebs", "steam_appid": 1902180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plebs</strong> is a casual base building real-time-strategy game that places you in an unexplored land ripe for expansion and conquest. Set in a time of ancient Nations, you are tasked with harvesting resources, crafting tools and weapons, feeding your Plebs, and training an army to defend against and conquer your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with a small settlement and a limited pool of resources, but with careful planning and strategic decision-making, you can flourish into a formidable empire. Be careful though, for you will not be the only Plebs trying to conquer the new world, <i>survival is not guaranteed</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/e9349941481fa212e48db9293a7965ab.poster.avif?t=1787393928\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/e9349941481fa212e48db9293a7965ab.webm?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/e9349941481fa212e48db9293a7965ab.mp4?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The life of a Pleb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Plebs are here to gather resources, mine for <strong>metal ores</strong>, construct buildings, train to become soldiers, and much more. They are the lifeblood of your town, but Plebs will become hungry over time - and a hungry Pleb cannot work quickly! You will need to provide a steady flow of food to ensure your town continues working at full speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/c01d3deb4b491a64344fe8915c689a35.poster.avif?t=1787393928\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/c01d3deb4b491a64344fe8915c689a35.webm?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/c01d3deb4b491a64344fe8915c689a35.mp4?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand your Settlement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building has a <strong>unique purpose</strong>, be it harvesting natural resources, growing food, expanding your town, refining metals, training soldiers, building vehicles, or expanding your population. As you grow and <strong>upgrade</strong> your town, new buildings will become available enabling better tools or stronger soldiers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/1bd6a993b354897047c8f2e9b19350e8.poster.avif?t=1787393928\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/1bd6a993b354897047c8f2e9b19350e8.webm?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/1bd6a993b354897047c8f2e9b19350e8.mp4?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you construct stalwart defences with upgraded <strong>Towers </strong>and <strong>Walls</strong>, boost your Plebs with <strong>Statues</strong> and <strong>Monuments</strong>, <strong>upgrade</strong> your buildings for faster production, or outmanoeuvre your enemies with <strong>Bridges</strong> and <strong>Roads</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/8b62e7f6c5885c71999251760ec83798.poster.avif?t=1787393928\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/8b62e7f6c5885c71999251760ec83798.webm?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/8b62e7f6c5885c71999251760ec83798.mp4?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Refine Metals for Tools &amp; Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your Plebs mine deeper into the ground they will discover a variety of <strong>different metals</strong>. Providing your workers and soldiers with <strong>higher quality metals</strong> makes them more effective, and you can even enhance your Plebs' <strong>metalworking skills</strong> to enable stronger tools &amp; weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you train a mighty force with the strongest metal weaponry, create a horde of weaker units to quickly overwhelm your enemies, or try to strike a balance between offence and defence? Each unit type has <strong>strengths and weaknesses</strong>, so careful army composition is vital to counter enemy forces effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/c443772372786cf7a5e6ff4300f9cc5b.poster.avif?t=1787393928\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/c443772372786cf7a5e6ff4300f9cc5b.webm?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/c443772372786cf7a5e6ff4300f9cc5b.mp4?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what if that is not enough to overcome your opponents? You may need to employ the mightiest warriors, the <strong>Champions</strong>. They can give you the edge in your conquest by healing your units, rebuilding damaged buildings, boosting your Plebs, or strengthening your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/94c372a24772915b663b6b93ca9bcc75.poster.avif?t=1787393928\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/94c372a24772915b663b6b93ca9bcc75.webm?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/94c372a24772915b663b6b93ca9bcc75.mp4?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Path to Glory</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through a series of unique challenges for each of the three unique Nations in the <strong>Campaign </strong>mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own <strong>Singleplayer</strong> or <strong>PvP</strong> <strong>Multiplayer</strong> custom game on a variety of different levels in <strong>Skirmish</strong> mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against endless waves of enemies in the <strong>Survival</strong> mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As a solo dev, reviews mean so much to me. If you enjoy the game, please consider leaving a review to help others find it!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plebs</strong> is a casual base building real-time-strategy game that places you in an unexplored land ripe for expansion and conquest. Set in a time of ancient Nations, you are tasked with harvesting resources, crafting tools and weapons, feeding your Plebs, and training an army to defend against and conquer your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with a small settlement and a limited pool of resources, but with careful planning and strategic decision-making, you can flourish into a formidable empire. Be careful though, for you will not be the only Plebs trying to conquer the new world, <i>survival is not guaranteed</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/e9349941481fa212e48db9293a7965ab.poster.avif?t=1787393928\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/e9349941481fa212e48db9293a7965ab.webm?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902180/extras/e9349941481fa212e48db9293a7965ab.mp4?t=1787393928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The life of a Pleb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Plebs are here to gather resources, mine for <strong>metal ores</strong>, construct buildings, train to become soldiers, and much more. They are the lifeblood of your town, but Plebs will become hungry over time - and a hungry Pleb cannot work quickly! You will need to provide a steady flow of food to ensure your town continues working at full speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo